  "body": "Prime Browns Bay Development Site with Sea Views\r\n\r\nRare 629sqm (more or less) freehold site offering sea views, privacy, and excellent development potential.\r\n\r\nLocated in a quiet, family-friendly neighbourhood within walking distance of Browns Bay Beach, cafés, restaurants, shops, and all local amenities.\r\n\r\n-Sea views\r\n-629sqm (more or less)\r\n-Potential for up to 3 dwellings (subject to council approval)\r\n-Private and peaceful location\r\n-Walk to the beach and Browns Bay village\r\n-Highly desirable North Shore location\r\n\r\nEnjoy the ultimate coastal lifestyle with Browns Bay Beach, vibrant cafés, restaurants, supermarkets, quality schools, parks, library, and public transport all within easy walking distance. This sought-after location combines convenience, lifestyle, and development potential in one of the North Shore's most desirable beachside suburbs.\r\n\r\nPlease note that construction activities have commenced on site. For safety and security reasons, all viewings and site inspections must be arranged in advance and are strictly by appointment with the owner's permission.\r\n\r\nA fantastic opportunity in one of Auckland's most sought-after coastal suburbs. \r\n\r\n\"The property is not affected by any known flood or water hazard areas.\"\r\n\r\nContact us today for more information.",
